1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,276
Try this family.

2
00:00:01,276 --> 00:00:05,286
An unaffected couple in generation one has an affected daughter.

3
00:00:05,286 --> 00:00:10,169
A trait missing in both parents but present in the child must be recessive.

4
00:00:10,169 --> 00:00:11,406
Could it be X linked?

5
00:00:11,406 --> 00:00:17,200
No: an X linked recessive daughter needs an affected father, and hers is normal.

6
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:19,492
So it is autosomal recessive.

